final_prompt = "You are given extractions from multiple documents related to this query.\n\nQUERY:\nIdentify the movie (released before Dec 31, 2023) that satisfies ALL of the following:\n1) It stars a Ugandan-born actor who made their screen debut in the late 1970s and is noted for mastering several accents throughout their career.\n2) It was directed by someone who moved to Hollywood in the late 1980s and had exactly two Oscar nominations as of Dec 31, 2023.\n\nEXTRACTIONS:\n" + context_info + "\n\nTASK:\n- From the extractions, determine the single best-matching movie. Ensure BOTH constraints (actor and director) are simultaneously satisfied for that film.\n- If multiple candidates appear, choose the one with the strongest explicit evidence (quotes) for BOTH the actor’s attributes and the director’s attributes.\n- Output ONLY the exact movie title (no quotes, no extra words, no year)."

answer = llm_query(final_prompt)
return_result(answer.strip())